{"ID":"20240504154105-uhzozs7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154105-uhzozs7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154105-uhzozs7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617155020-suk1yb3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606174349-ki5l14s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"012禹馀粮（禹余粮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240617155145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240617155020-suk1yb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617155020-suk1yb3","updated":"20240617155020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617155020-jioplx3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801095627-pmsh1w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801095627-pmsh1w8","updated":"20240801095627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 646px;","style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹馀粮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹馀粮-20240801095627-k9tymjx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\" parent-style=\"width: 646px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617155145-8plaq7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617155145-8plaq7m","updated":"20240617155145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617155145-ejem6pj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240614154726-ju2g80n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154726-ju2g80n"}},{"ID":"20240614154727-1c8d1oh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154727-1c8d1oh","updated":"20240614154731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154727-is1icfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154727-is1icfd","updated":"20240614154727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154727-58foj5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154727-58foj5m","updated":"20240614154727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主咳逆寒热，烦满下（《御览》有痢字），赤白，血闭，症瘕，大热。炼饵服之，不饥，轻身延年。生池泽及山岛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154727-flg7du1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154727-flg7du1","updated":"20240614154727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名白余粮，生东海及池泽中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154727-8gzcyqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154727-8gzcyqv","updated":"20240614154727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：禹余粮出河东；《列仙传》云：赤斧，上华山取禹余粮；《博物志》云：世传昔禹治水，弃其所余食于江中，而为药也，按此出神农经，则禹非夏禹之禹，或本名白余粮，《名医》等移其名耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154945-ok2ofn0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154945-ok2ofn0"}},{"ID":"20240614154947-y86umrz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-y86umrz","updated":"20240614154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-67ppdd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-67ppdd9","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味甘寒。主咳逆，寒热烦满，下赤白，血闭，癥瘕，大热。炼饵服之，不饥，轻身延年。生池泽及山岛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-82rqa6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-82rqa6h","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，入足太阴脾、足少阴肾、足厥阴肝、手阳明大肠经。止小便之痛涩，收大肠之滑泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-p9epszs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-p9epszs","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"禹余粮丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"原方失载。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治汗家重发汗，恍惚心乱，小便已阴痛者。以发汗太多，阳亡神败，湿动木郁，水道不利，便后滞气梗涩，尿孔作痛。禹余粮甘寒收涩，秘精敛神，心火归根，坎阳续复，则乙木发达，滞开而痛止矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-28e4wnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-28e4wnh","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂禹余粮汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在石脂。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治大肠滑脱，利在下焦者，以其收湿而敛肠也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-i5m49zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-i5m49zq","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮敛肠止泄，功同石脂，长于泻湿，达木郁而通经脉，止少腹骨节之痛，治血崩闭经之恙，收痔瘘失血，断赤白带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154947-2jguqye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154947-2jguqye","updated":"20240614154947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煎汤，生研。作丸、散，煅红、醋淬、研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155115-l59dd5w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155115-l59dd5w"}},{"ID":"20240614155117-3btpzpb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155117-3btpzpb","updated":"20240614155121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155117-25wwcva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155117-25wwcva","updated":"20240614155117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、平，无毒。主治咳逆，寒热，烦满，下利赤白，血闭，症瘕，大热。治小腹痛结烦疼。练饵服之，不饥，轻身，延年。一名白余粮。生东海池泽，及山岛中或池泽中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155117-89jyl5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155117-89jyl5v","updated":"20240614155117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今多出东阳，形如鹅鸭卵，外有壳重叠，中有黄细末如蒲黄，无沙者为佳。近年茅山凿地大得之，极精好。乃有紫华靡靡。《仙经》服食用之。南人又呼平泽中有一种藤，叶如菝，根作块有节，似菝 而色赤，根形似薯蓣，谓为禹余粮。言昔禹行山乏食，采此以充粮，而必有余粮，今庐江闲便是也。适有人于铜官采空青于石坎，大得黄赤色石，极似今之余粮，而色过赤好，疑此是太一也。彼人呼为雌黄，试涂物，正如雄黄色尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155100-3fjcmfo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155100-3fjcmfo"}},{"ID":"20240614155101-56oiqtg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155101-56oiqtg","updated":"20240614155106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155101-4c8hn72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155101-4c8hn72","updated":"20240614155101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《本经》名白余粮，与太乙余粮功用皆同"}]},{"ID":"20240614155101-milw3kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155101-milw3kx","updated":"20240614155101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平，无毒。细研，水淘澄之，勿令有砂土。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155101-4y6v4xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155101-4y6v4xt","updated":"20240614155101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主咳逆寒热烦满，下痢赤白，血闭症瘕，大热。炼饵服之不饥，轻身延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155101-34mj4v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155101-34mj4v7","updated":"20240614155101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重可以去怯。禹余粮之重为镇固之剂，手足阳明血分药。其味甘，故治咳逆寒热烦满之病。其性涩，故主赤白带下，前后诸病。仲景治伤寒下利不止，心下痞硬，利在下焦，赤石脂禹余粮丸主之，取重以镇痞逆，涩以固脱泄也。抱朴子云∶禹余粮丸日再服，三日后令人多气力，负担远行，身轻不饥，即《本经》轻身延年之谓。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154739-6c0yi07","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154739-6c0yi07"}},{"ID":"20240614154740-t3ynpxc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154740-t3ynpxc","updated":"20240614154801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154740-h92fygy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154740-h92fygy","updated":"20240614154740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平，无毒．主治小腹痛结烦疼．一名白余粮．生东海及山岛中，或池"}]},{"ID":"20240614154740-z5mv73n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154740-z5mv73n","updated":"20240614154803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶禹余粮，味甘，寒．主咳逆寒热烦满，下赤白，血闭症瘕，大热．炼饵服之，不饥，轻身延年。生池泽及山岛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154855-51s2jnm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154855-51s2jnm"}},{"ID":"20240614154856-18ut94d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154856-18ut94d","updated":"20240614154902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154856-88pw81o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154856-88pw81o","updated":"20240614154858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"禹余粮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生东海池泽及山岛中，或池泽中，今惟泽、潞州有之。旧说形如鹅鸭卵，外有壳重叠，中有黄，细末如蒲黄。今图上者，全是山石之形，都不作卵状，与旧说小异。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154856-byrp2gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154856-byrp2gv","updated":"20240614154856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》又有太一余粮。谨按陶隐居《登真隐诀》载长生四镇丸云∶太一禹余粮，定六腑，镇五脏。注云∶按本草有太一余粮、禹余粮两种，治体犹同。而今世惟有禹余粮，不复识太一．此方所用，遂合其二名，莫辨何者的是。而后小镇直云∶禹余粮，盒饭用之耳。余粮多出东阳山岸间，茅山甚有，好者状如牛黄，重重甲错，其佳处乃紫色，泯泯如面，啮之无复碜，虽然用之，宜细研，以水洮取汁澄之，勿令有沙土也。而苏恭亦云∶太一余粮与禹余粮，本一物，而以精粗为别，故一名太一禹余粮，其壳若瓷，初在壳中，未凝结者，犹是黄水，久凝乃有数色，或青或白，或赤或黄，年多渐变紫色，自赤及紫，俱名太一，其诸色通谓之余粮也。今医家但用余粮，亦不能如此细分别耳，张仲景治伤寒下痢不止，心下痞硬，利在下焦者，赤石脂禹余粮汤主之，赤石脂、禹余粮各一斤，并碎之，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，分再服。又按张华《博物志》曰∶扶海洲上，有草焉，名曰 草，其实食之，如大麦，从七月稔熟，民敛至冬乃迄，名自然谷，亦曰禹余粮。今药中有禹余粮者，世传昔禹治水，弃其所余食于江中，而为药也。然则 草与此异物而同名也。其云弃之江中而为药，乃与生海池泽者同种乎？"}]},{"ID":"20240614154844-lgcydef","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154844-lgcydef"}},{"ID":"20240614154845-5x2cxgx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154845-5x2cxgx","updated":"20240614154848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154845-n1kqajq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154845-n1kqajq","updated":"20240614154845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）体重镇怯固脱"}]},{"ID":"20240614154845-ufwrfcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154845-ufwrfcb","updated":"20240614154845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮（专入大肠。兼入心肾）。甘平。性涩质重。（时珍曰。生于池泽者为禹余粮。生于山谷者为太乙余粮。其中水黄浊者为石中黄水。其凝结如粉者为余粮。凝干如石者为石中黄。性味功用皆同。但入药有精粗之等耳。故服食家以黄水为上。太乙次之。禹余粮又次之。但禹余粮乃石中黄粉。）既能涩下固脱。复能重以祛怯。仲景治伤寒下利不止。心下痞硬。利在下焦。赤石脂禹余粮丸主之。取重以镇痞硬。涩以固脱泄也。（时珍曰。禹余粮手足阳明血分重剂也。其性涩。故主下焦前后诸病。）功与石脂相同。而禹余之质重于石脂。石脂之温过于余粮。不可不辨。取无砂者良。牡丹为使。细研淘取汁澄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154834-8n186t8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154834-8n186t8"}},{"ID":"20240614154835-gudjejh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-gudjejh","updated":"20240614154840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-jpavrk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-jpavrk2","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒，味甘。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-sw410k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-sw410k0","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主咳逆寒热烦满，下痢赤白，血闭，症瘕大热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-el0udio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-el0udio","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》云∶重可去怯。禹余粮之重，为镇固之剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-w7jr6ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-w7jr6ws","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》注云∶仲景治伤寒下痢不止，心下痞硬，利在下焦者，赤石脂禹余粮汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-adg7926","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-adg7926","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤石脂、禹余粮各一斤。并碎之，以水六升，煎取二升，去渣，分二服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154835-89uj7kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154835-89uj7kc","updated":"20240614154835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公》云∶看如石，轻敲便碎，可如粉也。兼重重如叶子雌黄，此能益脾，安五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154803-ahxsa0k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154803-ahxsa0k"}},{"ID":"20240614154808-lv4nh8w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154808-lv4nh8w","updated":"20240614154812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154808-q3e2xui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154808-q3e2xui","updated":"20240614154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮，味甘，气寒，无毒。入脾、胃、大肠。疗血闭瘕症，止赤白漏下，除寒热烦满、咳逆邪伤。经曰∶重可去怯。禹余粮之重，正镇固之剂，可用之止滑也。但只可暂用以固脱，不可久服以延年。《本经》言耐老轻身，予不敢信。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154808-8hg56ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154808-8hg56ak","updated":"20240614154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问禹余粮，传大禹治水之时，弃粮于山中，乃成此物，故凶荒之时，可掘而服食以救饥，果有之乎？曰∶此好事者之言也。禹余粮乃山中之土，异于凡土则有之，岂能疗饥以活命。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154808-hvlavo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154808-hvlavo2","updated":"20240614154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫饥馑之民，肠胃未有不虚弱者也。用禹余粮之重物以充饥，非充饥也。正所以速之死耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154808-7qqxzq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154808-7qqxzq8","updated":"20240614154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吕仙曰∶远公注《本草》，悯禹余粮之不可救荒，请命于我。我嘉远公善心之无穷也，传一法以救饥。遇凶荒之年，朝东方日出时，心中注定于太阳，不必朝对太阳也，用口开吸太阳之气，自觉为我吞入，咽下腹中一口，口中漱津一口，咽送腹中，如此七次，不必再咽。但饮滚水、食青草，再不死矣。此救饥之妙法也，特志之。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174345-ve4jvqm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606174345-ve4jvqm"}},{"ID":"20240614154712-pxf8svy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154712-pxf8svy","updated":"20240614154720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154712-s2oi5i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154712-s2oi5i5","updated":"20240614154712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入阳明血分有功．治利镇虚．崩带并疗能固下．秉太乙土精无毒．色黄质重．甘平兼涩性中和．（禹余粮出山谷池泽间．乃石中黄粉或土之未成石者．其质重．其色黄．其味甘涩．其性微寒．为手足阳明血分镇固之药也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614154431-lvcjon3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154431-lvcjon3"}},{"ID":"20240614154703-m1a90b7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154703-m1a90b7","updated":"20240614154706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154703-w133tgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154703-w133tgp","updated":"20240614154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘寒，无毒。主治咳逆，寒热烦满，下赤白，血闭，症瘕大热，炼饵服之，不饥，轻身延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154703-m3jivlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154703-m3jivlm","updated":"20240614154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（禹余粮始出东海池泽及山岛中，今多出东阳泽州、潞州，石中有细粉如面，故曰余粮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154703-lpcj071","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154703-lpcj071","updated":"20240614154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰∶禹余粮乃石中黄粉，生于池泽，其生于山谷者，为太一余粮也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614154703-k1zd1td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154703-k1zd1td","updated":"20240614154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仲祖《伤寒论》云∶汗家重发汗，必恍惚心乱，小便已阴痛，宜禹余粮丸。全方失传，世亦罕用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154431-sanekhs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154431-sanekhs"}},{"ID":"20240614154648-qa3zbuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154648-qa3zbuf","updated":"20240614154655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154648-2xny01l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154648-2xny01l","updated":"20240614154648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘寒，无毒。主咳逆，（补中降气不使以逆。）寒热（除脾胃湿滞之寒热，非谓可以通治寒热。）烦满，（性寒除热，即可上止烦；质重降逆，即可以泄满。）下利赤白。（除湿热之功。）血闭，症瘕。（消湿热所滞之淤积。）大热。（热在阳明者，热必甚，此能除之。）炼饵，服之不饥，（其质类谷粉而补脾土，所以谓之粮而能充饥也。）轻身延年。（补养后天之效。）按李时珍曰∶生池泽者，为禹余粮；生山谷者，为太一余粮。《本经》虽分两种，而治体则同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154505-nkb6qnm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154505-nkb6qnm"}},{"ID":"20240614154637-wywd7cr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154637-wywd7cr","updated":"20240614154643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154637-4nq7co9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154637-4nq7co9","updated":"20240614154637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮壳味甘寒，大热烦满不自安，咳逆 瘕并痞痢，崩带赤白镇之安。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154637-h9ekfx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154637-h9ekfx9","updated":"20240614154637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大禹行山乏食，采以弃粮而弃其余。无毒。主大热邪气，咳逆寒热烦满，血闭 瘕，伤寒下痢不止，心下痞硬，利在下焦，及妇人崩中带下赤白。《本经》云∶重可以去怯，禹余粮之重为镇固之剂也。又治小腹痛结及骨节烦疼，四肢不仁，痔 等疾。久服益脾，安五脏，耐寒暑，轻身延年。形如鸭卵，外有壳重迭，轻敲则碎，中有黄细末如蒲黄者佳。如卵内有子一块者，不堪用，令人肠干。火 醋淬七次，研末水飞，用杜仲、牡丹为使，畏贝母、菖蒲、铁落。又有一种石中黄，即禹余粮壳中未成粮黄浊水也，功同上，去壳研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154506-5dufngb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154506-5dufngb"}},{"ID":"20240614154528-pv9od9j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-pv9od9j","updated":"20240614154532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-iefm1l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-iefm1l7","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绩平水土。有如神禹。故名。出东海池泽。凡山岛中池泽亦有之。形如鹅鸭卵。裹壳重叠。中有黄色细末。如蒲黄。无沙者佳。近出茅山池泽中者极精好。状如牛黄。重重甲错。其佳处乃紫色靡靡如面。嚼之无碜。（碜。食有沙也。）味甘咸。气平寒。治咳逆寒热烦满。主崩中。下赤白血闭症瘕。大热。疗小腹痛结烦疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-mk91zra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-mk91zra","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炼饵服之不饥。方书治气证胀满。咳嗽遗矢。癫。泄泻。血痢遗精。禹余粮水土之精气所钟。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-boqhdku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-boqhdku","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"土劣水势偏。得水气之专精者也。气味甘寒。对待火热及水土浊邪。（聚为寒热。为咳逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-hzj46am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-hzj46am","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为烦满。为赤白。为血闭。为症瘕。）或肾形无坚固性。致洪水泛滥者。（子由）伤寒下痢不止。心下痞硬。利在下焦者。赤石脂禹余粮各一斤。并碎之。水六升。煮取一升。去渣分再服。崩漏五色。使人无子。禹余粮赤石脂牡蛎各研乌贼骨伏龙肝桂心等分。为末。每温酒服方寸匕。忌葱蒜。产后烦躁。禹余粮一枚。入地埋一半。紧筑。炭灰一斤之。湿土罨一宿。打破。去外面石。取里面细者。研水淘五七度。日干。再研万遍。用甘草汤服二钱。一服立效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-ul67cn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-ul67cn6","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕余粮二种。咸钟水土精气融结成形。而禹余偏得水气之专精者。夫甘寒除热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-8kfc6b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-8kfc6b0","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即草木类能奏功。惟是水之精。假合于土。以全地道之生化。则其具足水流土止生化离合之精气。谅非草木所得侪。故能益下焦阴虚而除烦热痛结。如女子产后烦躁。投之立效。是一的证也。禹粮能除下焦阴中之邪。赤脂能收下焦阴中之气。故相合以成镇固之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154528-buy674z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154528-buy674z","updated":"20240614154528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕细研。水淘取汁。澄之。勿令有沙土可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154506-oroqm3c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154506-oroqm3c"}},{"ID":"20240614154517-do5jaet","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154517-do5jaet","updated":"20240614154522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154517-3x0vvui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154517-3x0vvui","updated":"20240614154517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒。主咳逆，补中降气，不使上逆。寒热，除脾胃气虚，及有湿滞之寒热。烦满，补脾之功。下赤白，质燥性寒，故能除湿热之疾。血闭症瘕，消湿热所滞之瘀积。大热。热在阳明者必甚，此能除之。炼饵服之，不饥，其质类谷粉而补脾土，所以谓之粮而能充饥也。轻身延年。补养后天之效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154517-g65r1k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154517-g65r1k9","updated":"20240614154517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮，色黄、质腻、味甘，乃得土气之精以生者也。故补益脾胃，除热燥湿之功为多。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154517-7b0zi2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154517-7b0zi2d","updated":"20240614154517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡一病各有所因，治病者必审其因而治之，所谓求其本也。如同一寒热也，有外感之寒热，有内伤之寒热，有杂病之寒热，若禹余粮之所治，乃脾胃湿滞之寒热也。后人见本草有治寒热之语，遂以治凡病之寒热，则非惟不效，而且有害。自宋以来，往往蹈此病，皆本草不讲之故耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154506-z2evwjj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154506-z2evwjj"}},{"ID":"20240614154507-ilp9m08","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154507-ilp9m08","updated":"20240614154512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154507-xf2hbl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154507-xf2hbl1","updated":"20240614154507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、平，无毒。主咳逆，寒热、烦满，下赤白，血闭、症瘕、大热，疗小腹痛结烦疼。练饵服之，不饥、轻身、延年。一名白余粮。生东海池泽，及山岛中或池泽中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154507-761y5zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154507-761y5zw","updated":"20240614154507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今多出东阳，形如鹅鸭卵，外有壳重叠，中有黄细末如蒲黄，无沙者为佳。近年茅山凿地大得之，极精好，乃有紫华靡靡。《仙经》服食用之。南人又呼平泽中有一种藤，叶如菝 ，根作块有节，似菝 而色赤，根形似薯蓣，谓为禹余粮。言昔禹行山乏食，采此以充粮，而者，即是太一也。张华云∶池多蓼者，必有余粮，今庐江间便是也。适有人于铜官采空青于石坎，大得黄赤色石，极似今之余粮，而色过赤好，疑此是太一也。彼人呼为雌黄，试涂物，正如雄黄色尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154507-uo24fa2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154507-uo24fa2","updated":"20240614154507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕陶云∶“黄赤色石，疑是太一。”既无壳裹，未是余粮，疑谓太一，殊非的称。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154432-w8g7kd8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154432-w8g7kd8"}},{"ID":"20240614154458-904ufdx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-904ufdx","updated":"20240614154502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154458-5eo6wvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-5eo6wvg","updated":"20240614154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石中有细粉如面故曰余粮．凡用．研水取汁澄之．勿令有沙土．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614154458-dzcj88o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-dzcj88o","updated":"20240614154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240614154458-4chhlah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-4chhlah","updated":"20240614154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘寒无毒．入手足阳明血分重剂也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614154458-shqm88k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-shqm88k","updated":"20240614154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240614154458-x7dg598","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154458-x7dg598","updated":"20240614154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳逆寒热烦满．下赤白．血闭症瘕大热．炼饵服之不饥．轻身延年．疗小腹痛结烦疼．主崩中．治邪气及骨节疼四肢不仁痔 等疾．久服耐寒暑．催生固大肠．夫重可去怯．禹余粮之重为镇固之剂．其性涩又主下焦前后诸病．"}]},{"ID":"20240614154432-qk9sywj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154432-qk9sywj"}},{"ID":"20240614154448-pava5i8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-pava5i8","updated":"20240614154452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-bjad2tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-bjad2tr","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名白余粮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-g59aeik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-g59aeik","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-0hi8wol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-0hi8wol","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-r69do2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-r69do2v","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、大肠咳嗽（每咳便排出粪来）。用赤石脂、禹余粮各一斤，打碎，加水六升，煮成一升。去掉渣滓，分两次服。此方名“赤石脂禹余粮汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-ajs328v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-ajs328v","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、肠泄不止。用禹余粮四两（火煅、醋淬），加乌头一两，冷水浸一夜，去皮脐。两药共焙为末。稍滴醋加糊，做成丸子，如梧子大。饭前服五丸，温开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-9qsmzzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-9qsmzzq","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、赤白带。用禹余粮（火煅、醋淬），加干姜等分。如仅有赤带，则干姜减半。两药共研细。每服两茶匙，空心服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-87pkv91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-87pkv91","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、崩中漏下（月经过多，有各种颜色，小肚子痛，不能生育）。用禹余粮、赤石脂、牡蛎，分别煅过，共研细；加乌贼曲、伏龙肝（炒）、桂心，各药等分为末。每服一小茶匙，温酒送下。忌食葱蒜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154448-ujvdh0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154448-ujvdh0o","updated":"20240614154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、大风疠疾（眉发脱落，遍身顽痹）。用禹余粮二斤、白矾一斤、青盐一斤，共研细，装在罐子里，封牢，周围用炭火煅烧自晨至晚约十二小时。特冷却后，研细，埋土中三天。同时，每一两加胡麻（经过九蒸九晒，炒熟）粉三两。每服二钱，荆芥茶送下。一天服两次。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154432-4ztert0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154432-4ztert0"}},{"ID":"20240614154433-vt6ix4x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-vt6ix4x","updated":"20240614154441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-x1pfii8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-x1pfii8","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为斜方品系褐铁矿的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-n5vodu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-n5vodu9","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘、涩，平。入胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-xbny5ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-xbny5ae","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】涩肠止泻，收敛止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-0rfjv0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-0rfjv0c","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于久泻久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-qjw9zm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-qjw9zm9","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮涩大肠而止泻痢，与赤石脂作用相似，故两药常配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-gvhpvrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-gvhpvrg","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于崩漏带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-ka3f3q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-ka3f3q8","updated":"20240614154437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有固涩止血作用，治体虚崩漏可与党参、当归、熟地、赤石脂等同用；治带下可与乌贼骨、[]牡蛎等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-z9tjbrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-z9tjbrj","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】禹余粮、禹粮石、余粮石（打碎用）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-rxmaufa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-rxmaufa","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至八钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-aec5uks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-aec5uks","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】赤石脂禹余粮汤《伤寒论》：赤石脂、禹余粮。治伤寒下利不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-usg8vjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-usg8vjt","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主下赤白。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-hj48m49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-hj48m49","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性本草》：「主崩中。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614154433-7aochym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154433-7aochym","updated":"20240614154433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「催生，固大肠。」"}]},{"ID":"20240606174345-smu7v9q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606174345-smu7v9q"}},{"ID":"20240606174347-xgrbrp7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-xgrbrp7","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：禹余粮"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-e4nwvwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-e4nwvwf","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Yǔ Yú Liánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-pjtd2g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-pjtd2g8","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英文名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LIMONITUM"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-wv1wt96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-wv1wt96","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品为氢氧化物类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"褐铁矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，主含碱式氧化铁[FeO（OH）]。采挖后，除去杂石。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-76om2rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-76om2rh","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品为块状集合体，呈不规则的斜方块状，长5～10cm，厚1～3cm。表面红棕色、灰棕色或浅棕色，多凹凸不平或附有黄色粉末。断面多显深棕色与淡棕色或浅黄色相间的层纹，各层硬度不同，质松部分指甲可划动。体重，质硬。无臭，无味，嚼之无砂粒感。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-xskl8p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-xskl8p6","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鉴别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取本品粉末0.1g，加盐酸 2ml，振摇，静置，上清液显铁盐的鉴别反应（附录Ⅳ）。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-4fhwvy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-4fhwvy3","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制禹余粮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"： 除去杂石，洗净泥土，干燥，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-inaybpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-inaybpt","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"煅禹余粮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"： 取净禹余粮，打碎，照煅淬法（附录Ⅱ D）煅至红透。每100kg禹余粮 ，用醋30kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-pxhz03x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-pxhz03x","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘、涩，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-5wrjccw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-5wrjccw","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-d7w30ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-d7w30ql","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涩肠止泻，收敛止血。用于久泻，久痢，崩漏，白带。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-h5p5iom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-h5p5iom","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9～15g，煎汤或入丸散。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-75n2j3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-75n2j3o","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孕妇慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-n9829y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-n9829y0","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"贮藏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-isqz8ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-isqz8ac","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-dzimekx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-dzimekx","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：禹余粮"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-nteo0ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-nteo0ca","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Yǔ Yú Liánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-gso9fni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-gso9fni","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太一余粮、石脑（《本经》），禹哀，太一禹余粮（《吴普本草》），白余粮（陶弘景），禹粮石（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-wwiqb06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-wwiqb06","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-yn8hpi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-yn8hpi7","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为氧化物类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"褐铁矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的一种矿石。采挖后去净杂石即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-0tn9npu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-0tn9npu","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非晶质。常成葡萄状、肾状、乳房状、块状、土状等集合体。颜色为褐色到黑色，若为土状则为黄褐色或黄色。条痕为黄褐色。半金属光泽或土状光泽，有时作丝绢光泽。不透明。断面为介壳状或土状。硬度1～5.5。比重3.6～4.0。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-vzp4390","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-vzp4390","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要由含铁矿物经氧化分解后，再经水解汇集沉积而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-63k8aef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-63k8aef","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布很广。产河南、江苏、浙江、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-38g73ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-38g73ez","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为不规则的斜方块状，一般长6～10厘米，厚1～3厘米，表面淡棕色或红棕色，多凹凸不平，或覆有黄色粉末。断面显深棕色与淡棕色相间的层次，深棕色的部分质坚硬，但可砸碎，砸碎面不整齐而光滑；浅棕色的部分质较松，用指甲可以划动，其黄色粉末极易附着他物。有土腥气，味淡，嚼之无砂粒感。以整齐不碎、赭褐色、断面显层纹无杂石者为佳。部分溶于盐酸。其溶液显铁化合物的各种特殊反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-ngvdwdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-ngvdwdp","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"化学成分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为沼铁矿，主要成分大约相当于Fe2O3·3H2O，但因夹杂砂石、有机物等之量不同，所含Fe2O3可从20～78％不等；又常含多量的磷酸盐。青岛市售的禹余粮，主要成分为Fe203，又含Al，Mg，K，Na，PO4等。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-m2tx3ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-m2tx3ix","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮：拣去杂石，洗净泥土，干燥即得。煅禹余粮：取净禹余粮，打碎，置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅红透，倒入醋盆内淬酥，捞出，晒干。（每禹余粮100斤，用醋30斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-p896g9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-p896g9t","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡修治，用黑豆五合，黄精五合，水一斗，煮取五升，置瓷锅中，下余粮四两，煮，旋添，汁尽为度，自然香如新米，捣之，又研万杵，方用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-bhx573y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-bhx573y","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草蒙筌》：\"禹余粮火煅醋淬，复用磁钵重擂，水澄汁清，勿留沙土。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-741shep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-741shep","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘涩，平，"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-39rr0kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-39rr0kj","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-4195rmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-4195rmr","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"味咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-xrb3vfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-xrb3vfi","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"性涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-biplsr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-biplsr5","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入脾、胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-t96a74f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-t96a74f","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"手、足阳明血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-zpbmths","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-zpbmths","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入脾、胃、大肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-orgy0te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-orgy0te","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涩肠止血。治久泻久痢，妇人崩漏带下，痔漏。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-5p7fis6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-5p7fis6","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主咳逆，寒热烦满，下利赤白，血闭症瘕，大热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-m8l1uve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-m8l1uve","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮炙论》：\"益脾，安脏气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-aqaulyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-aqaulyl","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"疗小腹痛结烦疼。\"\"肢节不利，大饱绝力身重。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-d5p69mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-d5p69mo","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"主治崩中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-u5dcg9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-u5dcg9v","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"治邪气及骨节疼，四肢不仁，痔漏等疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-8h8adeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-8h8adeo","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"催生，固大肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-9vuiqxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-9vuiqxu","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《医林纂要》：\"补脾，敛固胃气，泻肝，去瘀血，厚大肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-x3h9nw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-x3h9nw9","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《现代实用中药》：\"外用为撒布剂，治溃疡。配合他种强壮药，作补血剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-pko4wd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-pko4wd2","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-3oauvk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-3oauvk7","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实证忌服，孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-3rchkhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-3rchkhj","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"杜仲为之使。畏贝母、菖蒲、铁落。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-iw2l5od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-iw2l5od","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《四声本草》：\"牡丹为使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-vrapw7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-vrapw7d","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"髓虚血燥之病勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-69rtvd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-69rtvd5","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治伤寒服汤药，下利不止，心下痞鞭。服泻心汤已，复以他药下之，利不止。医以理中与之，利益甚。理中者，理中焦，此利在下焦：赤石脂一斤（碎），禹余粮一斤（碎）。上二味，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，分温三服。（《伤寒论》赤石脂禹余粮汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-0zn2jhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-0zn2jhd","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治冷劳，大肠转泄不止：禹余粮四两（火烧令赤，于米醋内淬，如此七遍后，捣研如面），乌头一两（冷水浸一宿，去皮、脐，焙干，捣罗为末）。上药相和，用醋煮面和为丸如绿豆大。每服食前，以温水下五丸。（《圣惠万》神效太乙丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-8l6pro0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-8l6pro0","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治女人漏下，或瘥或剧，常漏不止，身体羸瘦，饮食减少，或赤或白或黄，使人无子者：牡蛎、伏龙肝、赤石脂、白龙骨、桂心、乌贼骨、禹余粮各等分。上七味，治下筛。空心酒服方寸匕，日二。白多者加牡蛎、龙骨、乌贼骨，赤多者加赤石脂、禹余粮，黄多者加伏龙肝、桂心，随病加之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-xhm4t6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-xhm4t6h","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治妇人带下：白下，禹余粮一两，干姜等分；赤下，禹余粮一两，干姜半两。上禹余粮用醋淬，捣研细为末。空心温酒调下二钱匕。（《胜金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-4m2kc9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-4m2kc9a","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治肠气痛，妇人少腹痛：禹余粮为末，每米饮服二钱，日二服。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-smiiwpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-smiiwpy","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治咳嗽则大肠遗矢者：禹余粮、赤石脂各等分。总和，以黑豆煮过，为极细末。每服二钱，白汤调服。（张元素）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-3fldfiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-3fldfiw","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治大风疠疾，眉发秃落，遍身顽痹：禹余粮二斤，白矾一斤，青盐一斤。为末，罐子固济，炭火一秤煅之，从辰至戌，候冷，研粉，埋土中，三日取出，每一两入九蒸九曝炒熟胡麻末三两。每服二钱，荆芥茶下，日二服。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-3dac1aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-3dac1aw","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧灭瘢痕：禹余粮、半夏等分。末之，以鸡子黄和。先以新布拭瘢令赤，以涂之勿见风，日二。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-p38w7yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-p38w7yf","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《注解伤寒论》：\"重可去怯，余粮之重以镇固。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-1trthjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-1trthjn","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"禹余粮，手、足阳明血分重剂也。其性涩，故主下焦前后诸病。李知先诗曰，下焦有病人难会，须用余粮赤石脂。《抱朴子》云，禹余粮丸日再服，三日后令人多气力。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-ihddvsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-ihddvsu","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草汇言》：\"禹余粮，养肺金，固大肠之药也。凡属水土不和，清浊混乱诸疾，用之奏效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-716k0sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-716k0sq","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《长沙药解》：\"禹余粮止小便之痛涩，收大肠之滑泄。《伤寒》禹余粮丸，治汗家重发汗，恍惚心乱，小便已阴痛者，以发汗太多，阳亡神败，湿动木郁，水道不利，便后滞气梗涩，尿孔作痛，禹余粮甘寒收涩，秘精敛神，心火归根，坎阳续复，则乙木发达，滞开而痛止矣。赤石脂禹余粮汤用之治大肠滑脱，利在下焦者，以其收湿而敛肠也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-num7uws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-num7uws","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草求真》：\"禹余粮功与石脂相同，而禹余粮之质，重于石脂，石脂之温，过于余粮，不可不辨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-crfyby0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-crfyby0","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-mudg3io","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-mudg3io","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：禹余粮"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-4h3743u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-4h3743u","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Yǔ Yú Liánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-9yfzaxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-9yfzaxl","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英文名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Limonite"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-iemxgu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-iemxgu4","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太一余粮、石脑、禹哀、太一禹余粮、白余粮、石中黄子、天师食、山中盈脂、石饴饼、石中黄、白禹粮、禹粮石、余粮石、禹粮土"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-8b80pjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-8b80pjt","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-sz67jah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-sz67jah","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《吴普本草》：太一禹余粮，生太山。上有甲，甲中有白，白中有黄，如鸡子黄色。九月采，或无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-zipx3jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-zipx3jn","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使禹余粮，勿用石中黄并卵石黄，此二名石真似禹余粮也。其石中黄向里赤黑黄，味淡微跙；卵石黄味酸，个个如卵，内有子一块，不堪用也。若误饵之，令人肠干。太一禹余粮，看即如石，轻敲便碎，可如粉也，兼重重如叶子雌黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-ru3l8g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-ru3l8g9","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.陶弘景：禹余粮，今多出东阳。形"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-pis8znl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-pis8znl","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为氧化物类矿物褐铁矿的一种矿石"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-n5xnz25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-n5xnz25","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Limonite"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-i9xfjpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-i9xfjpf","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采挖后去净杂石即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-o4u9chw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-o4u9chw","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"褐铁矿，非晶质。常成葡萄状、肾状、乳房状、块状、土状等集合体。颜色为褐色到黑色，若为土状则为黄褐色或黄色。条痕为黄褐色。半金属光泽或土状光泽，有时作丝绢光泽。不透明。断面为介壳状或土状。硬度1-5.5。比重3.6-4.0。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-c631d0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-c631d0h","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：主要由含铁矿物经氧化分解后，再经水解汇集沉积而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-bg7r016","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-bg7r016","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：主要产区有河北、江苏、浙江、河南。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-jevdvd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-jevdvd6","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别 本品呈卵球形的结核状，有核心或中空，但完整者少见；通常壳层与核心分离，壳层碎成不规则余方块状或扁块状，大小厚薄不等；表面多凹凸不平；土黄色、黄褐色、褐色；内表面粗糙，附有土黄色细粉；体重质坚，但可砸碎，断面层状，色泽不一，土黄色、褐色、紫褐色、灰青色；各层厚薄不等，一般褐色层或紫褐色层最厚。吣结核近圆球形，表面粗糙，附有细粉；黄褐色至褐色；断面不呈层次，而有许多蜂窝状小孔；有的砸破后，无核心，具黄粉，手触之污指，略有滑感。土腥气，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-cqtpckk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-cqtpckk","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 反射偏光镜下：矿物组分由水针铁矿、石英、长石、岩屑等碎屑组成。外壳褐铁矿会计师较中心部少。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-wye9tji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-wye9tji","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水针铁矿：反射光下呈胶状结构，蜂窝状构造；反射色为灰白色；略见非晶质，反射率17%（伏黄）；粒径约为0.01mm，集合体则为0.1mm；蜂窝空缺部分为粘土质和石英充填。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-pbgoi5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-pbgoi5y","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碎屑粒径一般为0.05-0.1mm，呈棱角状，半接触式的胶结。胶结物主要是粘土质、碳酸盐和铁质等。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-g2wpzqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-g2wpzqe","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"化学成分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要成分为碱式氧化铁[FeO(OH)]及碱式含水氧化铁[FeO(OH)]·Nh2o,并夹有泥土及有机质等。又常含多量的磷酸盐及铝、镁、钾、钠、等元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-zgjviqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-zgjviqn","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鉴别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)取本品粉末0.2g，加稀盐酸10ml，振摇，静置，滤液显铁盐的各种反应，参见“蛇含石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-uph7jhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-uph7jhi","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末少许，置于试管中，密闭，在火焰上加热，有小水珠附于试管壁的上方。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-a07mo6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-a07mo6t","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禹余粮：拣去杂石，洗净泥土，干燥即得。煅禹余粮：取净禹余粮，打碎，置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅红透，倒入醋盆内淬酥，捞出，晒干。(每禹余粮100斤，用醋30斤)1.《雷公炮炙论》：凡修治，用黑豆五合，黄精五台，水一斗，煮取五升，置瓷锅中，下余粮四两，煮，旋添，汁尽为度，自然香如新米，捣之，又研万杵，方用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-kfk4n98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-kfk4n98","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草蒙筌》：禹余粮火煅醋淬，复用磁钵重擂，水澄汁清，勿留沙土。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-0ttsdbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-0ttsdbj","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘涩；平；寒；咸"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-t8sktb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-t8sktb8","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-zbtfhtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-zbtfhtv","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涩肠；止血；止带。主久泻；久痢；妇人崩漏带下；便血"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-j3gox4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-j3gox4f","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：煎汤，3-5钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-0o6onmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-0o6onmw","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实证忌服，孕妇慎服。《本草汇言》：髓虚血燥之病勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-r9vlh90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-r9vlh90","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治伤寒服汤药，下利不止，，心下痞硬。服泻心汤已，复以他药下之，利不止。医以理中与之，利益甚。理中者，理中焦，此利在下焦：赤石脂一斤(碎)，禹余粮一斤(碎)。上二味，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，分温三服。(《伤寒论》赤石脂禹余粮汤)②治冷劳，大肠转泄不止：禹余粮四两(火烧令赤，于米醋内淬，如此七遍后，捣研如面)，乌头一两(冷水浸一宿，去皮、脐，焙干，捣罗为末)。上药相和，用醋煮面和为丸如绿豆大。每服食前，以温水下五丸。(《圣惠方》神效太乙丹)③治女人漏下，或瘥或剧，常漏不止，身体羸瘦，饮食减少，或赤或白或黄，使人无子者：牡蛎、伏龙肝、赤石脂、白龙骨、桂心、乌贼骨、禹余粮各等分。上七味，治下筛。空心酒服方寸匕，日二。白多者加牡蛎、龙骨、乌贼骨，赤多者加赤石脂、禹余粮，黄多者加伏龙肝、桂心，随病加之。(《千金方》)④治妇人带下：白下，禹余粮一两，干姜等分；赤下，禹余粮一两，干姜半两。上禹余粮用醋淬，捣研细为末。空心温酒调下二钱匕。(《胜金方》)⑤治肠气痛，妇人少腹痛：禹余粮为末，每米饮服二钱，日二服。(《卫生易简方》)⑥治咳嗽则大肠遗矢者：禹余粮、赤石脂各等分。总和，以黑豆煮过，为极细末。每服二钱，白汤调服。(张元素)⑦治大风疠疾，眉发秃落，遍身顽痹：禹余粮二斤，白矾一斤，青盐一斤。为末，罐子固济，炭火一秤煅之，从辰至戌，候冷，研粉，埋土中，三日取出，每一两入九蒸九曝炒熟胡麻末三两。每服二钱，荆芥茶下，日二服。(《圣惠方》)⑧灭瘢痕：禹余粮、半夏等分。末之，以鸡子黄和。先以新布拭瘢令赤，以涂之勿见风，日二。(《千金方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-fe1z84v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-fe1z84v","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《注解伤寒论》：重可去怯，余粮之重以镇固。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-0p4n6eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-0p4n6eb","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：禹余粮，手、足阳明血分重剂也。其性涩，故主下焦前后诸病。李知先诗曰，下焦有病人难会，须用余粮赤石脂。《抱朴子》云，禹余粮丸日再服，三日后令人多气力。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-j3m8yx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-j3m8yx0","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：禹余粮，养肺金，固大肠之药也。凡属水土不和，清浊混乱诸疾，用之奏效。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-a2hmp5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-a2hmp5i","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《长沙药解》：禹余粮止小便之痛涩，收大肠之滑泄。《伤寒》禹余粮丸，治汗家重发汗，恍惚心乱，小便已阴痛者，以发汗太多，阳亡神败，湿动木郁，水道不利，便后滞气梗涩，尿孔作痛，禹余粮甘寒收涩，秘精敛神，心火归根，坎阳续复，则乙木发达，滞开而痛止矣。赤石脂禹余粮汤用之治大肠滑脱，利在下焦者，以其收湿而敛肠也。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-ncbft2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-ncbft2s","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草求真》：禹余粮功与石脂相同，而禹余粮之质，重于石脂，石脂之温，过于余粮，不可不辨。"}]},{"ID":"20240606174347-o2hqsrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174347-o2hqsrz","updated":"20240606174347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606174348-bs0zi1x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606174348-bs0zi1x"}},{"ID":"20240606174349-ki5l14s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606174349-ki5l14s"}}]}